  "notes": "Bubble Gum Simulator Infinity is a clicker and pet game from Rumble Studios. You blow bubble gum to grow a bigger bubble, then use it to float higher and reach new islands in the sky. Along the way you sell bubbles for coins, hatch eggs for pets, and build a pet team that boosts your bubble size, coins and luck.\n\nAlmost every code gives potions called Elixirs, and Infinity Elixirs show up the most. An Infinity Elixir stacks several boosts at once, so it works best right before a long egg-hatching session. The game updates every Friday, and new codes tend to come with bigger updates, seasonal events and visit milestones. Rumble Studios shares them in its Discord and update notes.",
